## The export: landed statement and shim statement elaborate to the same type
```
@Turing.embedSilentCfg_cap : ∀ {m k : ℕ} {S : Type u_1} {Symbol : Type u_2} {x : List Symbol} (ι : Fin m ↪ Fin k),
  ∀ cap ∉ Set.range ⇑ι,
    ∀ (tapes : Fin k → ℤ → Option Symbol) (heads : Fin k → ℤ) (pre out₀ : List Symbol) (c : Turing.Cfg m Symbol S x),
      (Turing.embedSilentCfg ι cap tapes heads pre out₀ c).workTapes cap = Turing.FinTM.bufferTape (pre ++ c.output) ∧
        (Turing.embedSilentCfg ι cap tapes heads pre out₀ c).workTapePos cap = ↑(pre ++ c.output).length
```
